{"2241860":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"World of Fate","steam_appid":2241860,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a massive real-world strategy sandbox: seize control of actual streets and buildings on a live map, then build and expand your empire from the ground up. Using real-time street and building data, every city block, factory and landmark is rendered dynamically—no two matches are ever the same.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Real-world map integration: conquer genuine cities and terrain powered by live geodata<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Empire management: oversee armies, logistics networks, resource-processing factories and supply hubs<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Infrastructure control: build and upgrade housing, hospitals and barracks to support your forces<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Advanced warfare: train customized squads, manufacture and launch missiles for strategic advantage<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple modes: play single-player, co-op or competitive multiplayer against friends or AI empires<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your destiny on Earth’s streets—your empire awaits.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a massive real-world strategy sandbox: seize control of actual streets and buildings on a live map, then build and expand your empire from the ground up. Using real-time street and building data, every city block, factory and landmark is rendered dynamically—no two matches are ever the same.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Real-world map integration: conquer genuine cities and terrain powered by live geodata<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Empire management: oversee armies, logistics networks, resource-processing factories and supply hubs<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Infrastructure control: build and